### Body (PDCA + four violation kinds)

- **Purpose** — Plan/Do/Check/Adjust tied to `layoutGridConsistencyReport` and check thresholds (32 words, 88%/82% bleed, 920 px measure, 56 px gutter drift, 64 px handbook gap @ 992 px).
- **Passing / failing signals** — All four `kind` values from the check: `full-bleed-prose`, `gutter-drift`, `excessive-measure`, `handbook-dead-gutter`.
- **Before** — `main.doc-main` + `forge-section ks-section` with bare `p.forge-support` (no `.doc-content`) and `margin-left:72px` on sibling (matches harness fixture).
- **After** — Same section wrapped in `mx-auto doc-content` with `max-width:56rem`; notes **Ksr** / `doc-content w-100` + `.ks-doc-toc-prose` pattern.
- **Evidence and remediation** — Report fields, finding evidence strings, five-step fix order including `content_max_width=None` in `layouts.py`.
- **Related rules** — Six linked DET/AI rules (including new `DET.NAV.IN_PAGE_TOC`).

